data: {"id": "3220bd48adbf48fe-thinking-parallel_evidence-667", "run_id": "3220bd48adbf48fe", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 首轮可观测性结果分析\n\n根据已执行的工具结果，分析如下：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Metrics (execute_pod_promql) - present\n- **等待原因**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`，`reason=\"ContainerCreating\"`，容器 `app`\n- **Pod 状态**: `kube_pod_status_phase=1` for `phase=\"Pending\"`，`Running/Succeeded/Failed/Unknown` 均为 0\n- **重启次数**: `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0`，容器从未启动过\n- **Node**: 调度到 `node2`\n\n**结论**: Metrics 确认 Pod 仍处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 阶段，无重启，未进入 Running。\n\n### 2. Logging (query_pod_logs) - empty\n- 最近 30 分钟无", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788779772794, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

