data: {"id": "3220bd48adbf48fe-thinking-parallel_evidence-1356", "run_id": "3220bd48adbf48fe", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实汇总\n\n### Kubernetes 事件 (kubectl_events) - 关键证据\n- **事件原因**: `FailedCreatePodSandBox` + `NoNetworkFound`\n- **根因描述**: `cannot find network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-network' in namespace aiops-case-05`\n- **组件**: `Multus CNI plugin (multus-cni-network) failed`\n- **时间**: 事件发生在 23m-26m 前\n\n### Pod 描述 (kubectl_describe) - 关键证据\n- **状态**: Pending，Reason: ContainerCreating\n- **调度节点**: node2 (10.2.0.50)\n- **Annotation**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`\n- **Warning 事件**: \n ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788779795961, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

